Today is Thursday.
It is seven o'clock in the evening.
My gym is over now.
Now I go to the mechanic's shop.
I go to take my bicycle back.
Bhaiya is in his shop.
I say to him, "Hello bhaiya."
Bhaiya says, "Hello madam, your bicycle is ready."
I look at my bicycle.
My bicycle is ready right on time.
Bhaiya always works on time.
The bicycle looks as good as new.
I say, "Thank you bhaiya."
Bhaiya smiles and says, "I am here every day."
I ride the bicycle sometimes.
Now my bicycle is completely fine.
I take my bicycle.
Now I go home on my bicycle.
